Privacy Policy for Bedtime Stories

Last Updated: December 27, 2025

"Bedtime Stories" ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application (the "App").

By using the App, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.

1. Information We Collect

A. Personal Information

When you create an account, we may collect the following personal information:

Email Address: Used for authentication and account recovery.

Name (Optional): Used to personalize your experience.

B. User-Generated Content

We collect the data you provide to generate stories, including:

Story Prompts: Hero names, descriptions, settings, plots, and other creative inputs.

Generated Content: The stories, images, and audio files created by our AI services based on your inputs.

C. Usage Data

We may collect information on how you access and use the App, including:

Device type and operating system.

App usage timestamps and interaction history.

Crash logs and performance data.

D. Transaction Data

We use third-party services to process payments. We do not store your credit card information directly. We track:

Purchase history (e.g., coin packs bought).

Coin balance and usage.

2. How We Use Your Information

We use the collected information for the following purposes:

To Provide Service: To generate text, images, and audio for your custom stories using Artificial Intelligence.

Authentication: To manage your account and login access via Firebase Authentication.

Transactions: To process in-app purchases and manage your virtual currency ("Coins") using RevenueCat.

Improvement: To monitor App performance and improve user experience.

Communication: To send you important updates regarding your account or the Service (e.g., email verification).

